## Environment Variables (.env)
```
SARVAM_API_KEY=your_key_here
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key_here   # Optional, only for /transcribe endpoint
LOCAL_LLM_SIZE=3B              # Options: 0.5B, 1.5B, 3B — local fallback only

# Kaggle GPU — set KAGGLE_ENABLED=true only while notebook session is running
KAGGLE_ENABLED=false
KAGGLE_API_BASE_URL=https://xxxx.trycloudflare.com
KAGGLE_API_SECRET=veda-kaggle-dev
KAGGLE_API_TIMEOUT=120

# Provider routing: local | kaggle | auto
# Default local on laptop; set to kaggle when Kaggle notebook is up
LLM_PROVIDER=local
TRANSLATE_PROVIDER=local
LAYOUT_PROVIDER=local
UPSCALE_PROVIDER=local
```
When Kaggle hours are spent: set `KAGGLE_ENABLED=false` (or stop notebook) — all
providers automatically use laptop fallback without code changes.

