## Installed Dependencies (server/vendor/)
- fastapi, uvicorn, edge-tts — core backend
- pymupdf (fitz) — PDF parsing + image extraction
- pdfplumber, pdfminer.six — layout-aware text extraction (column detection, image-zone filtering)
  - cryptography + cffi installed system-wide (not in vendor) — required by pdfminer.six
- llama-cpp-python — local LLM inference
- torch (CPU build) — required for NLLB-200 translation and Real-ESRGAN upscaling
- transformers, sentencepiece, sacremoses — NLLB-200 model loading and tokenization
- Pillow, opencv-python-headless, torchvision — image processing for /upscale_image
- requests, python-dotenv, httpx — HTTP and config
- elevenlabs, openai — optional TTS/STT alternatives

